; The unsigned zone `just capture-authoritative signed` has Knot sign (D209): the names of RFC 5155 Appendix A's zone
; (RFC 5155 Appendix A, with its DS at `a.example.`, its opt-out insecure delegation `c.example.`, its wildcard
; and its empty non-terminal `y.w.example.`) and a CNAME. The signed zone is `authoritative/zones/nsec3-signed.zone`.
$ORIGIN example.
$TTL 3600
@       SOA ns1 bugs.x.w 1 3600 300 3600000 3600
        NS  ns1
        NS  ns2
        MX  1 xx
ns1     A   192.0.2.1
ns2     A   192.0.2.2
a       NS  ns1.a
        NS  ns2.a
        DS  58470 5 1 3079F1593EBAD6DC121E202A8B766A6A4837206C
ns1.a   A   192.0.2.5
ns2.a   A   192.0.2.6
ai      A     192.0.2.9
        HINFO "KLH-10" "ITS"
        AAAA  2001:db8::f00:baa9
c       NS  ns1.c
        NS  ns2.c
ns1.c   A   192.0.2.7
ns2.c   A   192.0.2.8
*.w     MX  1 ai
x.w     MX  1 xx
x.y.w   MX  1 xx
xx      A     192.0.2.10
        HINFO "KLH-10" "TOPS-20"
        AAAA  2001:db8::f00:baaa
alias   CNAME ai
